        },
        {
          "text": "Otarireeta omu nju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ekiconco kya maraaya nari eky'ekitingwa, kuhikiiriza eki waaraganiise noorahira kuha MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba ebyo n'ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ayangira kimwe.",
