          "text": " Ku origira eki waaraganisa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe noorahira, otaryeganda kukihikiiriza; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe taribura kukikubuuza, kikakurugiramu ekibi. ",
