          "text": " Ku oriza omu musiri gwa mutaahi waawe gw'emizaabibu, noikirizibwa kurya ebijuma by'emizaabibu nk'oku orikwenda, okahaaga; kwonka otarigira ebi waashoromera omu kintu eki oine. ",
